This code release accompanies the paper "Zero-Edge Inductive Link Prediction:
Re-Anchoring Cold Entities for Day-Zero Vulnerability Completion".

The RMPI backbone (subgraph extraction, relational message passing) in rmpi/
is derived from RMPI: https://github.com/zjukg/RMPI
(Geng, Yuxia et al., "Relational Message Passing for Fully Inductive Knowledge
Graph Completion", ICDE 2023). baselines/CoMPILE/ retains its upstream license
(Mai et al., "Communicative Message Passing for Inductive Relation Reasoning",
AAAI 2021). baselines/grail/data/WN18RR contains benchmark data
from Dettmers et al., "Convolutional 2D Knowledge Graph Embeddings", AAAI 2018.

